# R3-GATE0 governance ownership.
#
# These paths DEFINE the trusted verification gate itself (workflow, verifier scripts, frozen manifest).
# A PR that rewrites them could make the gate pass itself, so they require code-owner review. Combined
# with branch protection on `main` ("Require review from Code Owners" + the trusted-verification status
# check as a required check), this is the trust anchor a PR cannot bypass by editing the guard.
# CODEOWNERS only takes effect once that branch protection is configured — a POST-MERGE admin action
# (see docs/r3-gate0-trusted-verification.md §8). This file is harmless without it.

